=2 Walkthrough
* Travel to the frontier station in {z:Marjami Ravine} or {z:Yorcia Weald} and speak with the {n:Station Worker}.
* You will be presented with a list of various emotes from which you must choose one to cheer up the worker.
* To complete the assignment, the correct emote must be chosen while facing the {n:Station Worker} AND the direction listed below. You can utilize /point without having anything targeted to orient yourself.
** It is far easier to line up facing the correct direction using first-person view. (V Key by default on Keyboard.) Locking onto the NPC can also help.
** After each emote attempt, a dialogue will inform you whether the direction or emote was correct.
** Directions are approximate; take a few steps to the left or right if the angle is incorrect.
* The correct emote/direction changes every 3 game hours, so it is possible to warp back and forth from the {p:Mummers' Coalition} and rapidly repeat this quest once you figure out the proper emote/direction.

|^Time|Marjami Ravine|Yorcia Weald
|00:00-03:00|Rue your life (E)|Blush like a Maiden (NE)
|03:00-06:00|Cheer (SE)|Rally the troops (E)
|06:00-09:00|Pretend to be flustered (S)|Look Pleased (SE)
|09:00-12:00|Blush like a Maiden (SW)|Cry a river (S)
|12:00-15:00|Rally the troops (W)|Act Surprised (SW)
|15:00-18:00|Look Pleased (NW)|Rue your life (W)
|18:00-21:00|Cry a River (N)|Cheer (NW)
